      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This makes it really hard to make slight angles with your elbow when you have the arms up in the air, even with elbow trackers its the same. Its very jumpy between \"fully stretched\" and \"pretty big elbow angle\" when dancing with your arms above your head for example, and it just feels really weird and uncomfortable. \nHere is another Video where i demonstrate it with 2 different avatars: https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/946881839400882196/990243024384704523/2022-06-25_14-12-47.mp4",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
      "_id": "6367ded7b1431a29f1fa50fc",
