      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "62822c06e73e48464d0b4689",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": {
        "like": 1
      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "# Update:\nAccording to Kung this is intentional design. It allows for avatars which shoulder position does not match up with your IRL shoulder potion to fully stretch out their arms when you put them above your head.\nI can see why you would want this, though I can also see why you wouldn't. The best thing do would probably to make it an optional Setting in the Tracking & IK Category of the Main Menu Settings Tab. This would allow people who like this feature to still use it while those who don't can simply turn it off. It could be called something like `Overstretch Arms Above Head` or `Fully Stretch Out Arms Above Head`.\n# Attachments:\nHere is a screenshot of Kung explaining the feature:",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
    {
