      "internal": false,
      "mergeID": "6368d617c1224d559026789b",
      "mergedPostDetails": "This has happened on every avatar I've tested to varying extents.\nIt happens in both 3p and 6p tracking, I am unable to test 10p or 11p since I don't have that many trackers.\nWhenever the shoulder starts to move up, it offsets the rest of the arm so that it's no longer aligned with your actual hand/controller",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Shoulder IK causing hands to move away from controllers",
