  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "If you put your arms up, so stretch them out to your sealing, they will first start to stretch out more then your controllers are and them come back to them.\nYou can see this behavior here: https://streamable.com/lcv5pj\nThis doesn't feel right at all and makes it weird to put up your arms.",
